 "MY-H866": {
  "lawId": "MY-H866",
  "sourceLang": "ms",
  "targetLang": "en",
  "engine": "official-extract",
  "model": null,
  "promptVersion": null,
  "translatedAt": "2026-10-28",
  "reviewed": "official",
  "note": "公报原生英文版（与马来文版同一公报并置），逐字照录，非机译。",
  "articles": [
   {
    "no": 1,
    "text": {
     "en": "1. This order may be cited as the Loans Guarantee (Bodies Corporate) (Remission\nof Tax and Stamp Duty) (No. 3) Order 2018.\n\nApplication"
    },
    "noLabel": {
     "en": "Section 1"
    }
   },
   {
    "no": 2,
    "text": {
     "en": "2. This Order shall apply to—\n\n(a) the Murabahah Term Financing facility obtained or to be obtained by\nPerbadanan Tabung Pendidikan Tinggi Nasional amounting to three billion\nfive hundred million ringgit (RM3,500,000,000.00); and\n\n(b) the guarantee provided or to be provided by the Government of Malaysia in\nrelation to the Murabahah Term Financing.\n\nInterpretation"
    },
    "noLabel": {
     "en": "Section 2"
    }
   },
   {
    "no": 3,
    "text": {
     "en": "3. In this Order—\n\n      \"Murabahah Term Financing guarantee\" means the guarantee referred to in\nsubparagraph 2(b);\n\n\"Murabahah Term Financing\" means the facility referred to in subparagraph 2(a).\n\nRemission of tax"
    },
    "noLabel": {
     "en": "Section 3"
    }
   },
   {
    "no": 4,
    "text": {
     "en": "4. Any tax payable under the Income Tax Act 1967 [ Act 53 ] by any of the following\nindividual or entity in respect of any money payable under any agreement, note,\ninstrument and document in relation to the Murabahah Term Financing and the Murabahah\nTerm Financing guarantee shall be remitted in full:\n\n(a) Perbadanan Tabung Pendidikan Tinggi Nasional  to which the Loans\nGuarantee (Bodies Corporate) Act 1965 applies by virtue of the Loans\nGuarantee (Declaration of Bodies Corporate) ( Perbadanan Tabung\nPendidikan Tinggi Nasional) Order 2004 [P.U. (A) 408/2004]; or\n\n(b) any party to any agreement, note, instrument and document in relation to\nthe Murabahah Term Financing and the Murabahah Term Financing\nguarantee, including any party to whom such agreement, note, instrument\nand document are transferred or assigned.\n\nRemission of stamp duty"
    },
    "noLabel": {
     "en": "Section 4"
    }
   },
   {
    "no": 5,
    "text": {
     "en": "5. Any stamp duty payable under the Stamp Act 1949 [ Act 378 ] in respect of any\nagreement, note, instrument and document in relation to the  Murabahah Term Financing\nand the Murabahah Term Financing guarantee shall be remitted in full.\n\nMade 26 April 2018\n[KK/SID/(S)/696/1; PN(PU2)232/XIV]\n\nDATUK SERI JOHARI BIN ABDUL GHANI\nSecond Minister of Finance"
    },
    "noLabel": {
     "en": "Section 5"
    }
   }
  ]
 },
