 "MY-H909": {
  "lawId": "MY-H909",
  "sourceLang": "ms",
  "targetLang": "en",
  "engine": "official-extract",
  "model": null,
  "promptVersion": null,
  "translatedAt": "2026-10-28",
  "reviewed": "official",
  "note": "公报原生英文版（与马来文版同一公报并置），逐字照录，非机译。",
  "articles": [
   {
    "no": 1,
    "text": {
     "en": "1. (1) This order may be cited as the Electricity Supply (Electricity Industry\n\nFund) (Contribution by Tenaga Nasional Berhad) Order 2017.\n\n(2) This Order comes into operation on 8 April 2017.\n\nContribution by Tenaga Nasional Berhad"
    },
    "noLabel": {
     "en": "Section 1"
    }
   },
   {
    "no": 2,
    "text": {
     "en": "2. (1) Tenaga Nasional Berhad shall allocate and pay to the Electricity Industry\n\nFund all monies accrued, including interest, due to savings or penalty or any other\n\njustified reason, derived from implementing and enforcing the power purchase\n\nagreement with other licensees.\n\n(2) The monies shall be paid at the beginning of the calendar year or on any\n\nother date as may be specified by the Commission.\n\nMode of payment"
    },
    "noLabel": {
     "en": "Section 2"
    }
   },
   {
    "no": 3,
    "text": {
     "en": "3. (1) A payment to the Electricity Industry Fund shall be made by electronic\n\nfund transfer or any other method as may be determined by the Commision.\n\n(2) Tenaga Nasional Berhad shall submit proof of payment to the Commission\n\nwithin fourteen days after the payment is made and the Commission shall issue a\n\nreceipt for the payment made.\n\nRefund"
    },
    "noLabel": {
     "en": "Section 3"
    }
   },
   {
    "no": 4,
    "text": {
     "en": "4. (1) If Tenaga Nasional Berhad discovers that there has been an over payment\n\nto the Electricity Industry Fund, Tenaga Nasional Berhad may make a written\n\napplication to the Commission for the refund of the over payment.\n\n(2) The Commission shall, upon receiving the application and being satisfied\n\nthat there has been over payment of the contribution to the Electricity Industry Fund,\n\nrefund such over payment to the Tenaga Nasional Berhad without interest within thirty\n\ndays from the date of the verification of the over payment by the Commission.\n\nRecovery of shortfall"
    },
    "noLabel": {
     "en": "Section 4"
    }
   },
   {
    "no": 5,
    "text": {
     "en": "5. (1) If there is a shortfall in the allocation or payment made by Tenaga\n\nNasional Berhad, the Commission shall, as soon as practicable, notify Tenaga Nasional\n\nBerhad in writing of the shortfall and request Tenaga Nasional Berhad to pay the\n\nshortfall.\n\n(2) Tenaga Nasional Berhad shall pay the shortfall without interest within\n\nthirty days from the date of receipt of the notification.\n\nMade 10 March 2017\n\n[KeTTHA: (S)100-1/1/5; PN(PU2)486/VII]\n\nDATUK SERI PANGLIMA DR. MAXIMUS JOHNITY ONGKILI\n\nMinister of Energy, Green Technology and Water"
    },
    "noLabel": {
     "en": "Section 5"
    }
   }
  ]
 },
