 "MY-H919": {
  "lawId": "MY-H919",
  "sourceLang": "ms",
  "targetLang": "en",
  "engine": "official-extract",
  "model": null,
  "promptVersion": null,
  "translatedAt": "2026-10-28",
  "reviewed": "official",
  "note": "公报原生英文版（与马来文版同一公报并置），逐字照录，非机译。",
  "articles": [
   {
    "no": 1,
    "text": {
     "en": "1. This order may be cited as the Poisons (Amendment of Poisons List) (No. 2) Order 2014.\n\nAmendment of First Schedule"
    },
    "noLabel": {
     "en": "Section 1"
    }
   },
   {
    "no": 2,
    "text": {
     "en": "2. The Poisons Act 1952 is amended in the First Schedule—\n\n(a) in the Poisons List—\n\n(i) by inserting after the item \"Azelaic Acid\" and the particulars relating to it the following item:\n\nNames Part I Part II Exempt\n\nGroup A Group B Group C Group D\n\n\"Azilsartan - All preparations\";\n\n(ii) under the item \"Antihistamines; the following:\", by inserting after the item \"Bamipine\" the item \"Bilastine\";\n\n(iii) by inserting after the item \"Dantrolene; its salts\" and the particulars relating to it the following item:\n\nNames Part I Part II Exempt\n\nGroup A Group B Group C Group D\n\n\"Dapagliflozin - All preparations\";\n\n(iv) by inserting after the item \"Dolasetron Mesylate\" and the particulars relating to it the following item:\n\nNames Part I Part II Exempt\n\nGroup A Group B Group C Group D\n\n \"Dolutegravir - All preparations\";\n\n(v) by inserting after the item \"Lithium salts for therapeutic use\" and the particulars relating to it the following item:\n\nNames Part I Part II Exempt\n\nGroup A Group B Group C Group D\n\n\"Lixisenatide - All preparations\";\n\n(vi) by inserting after the item \"Minoxidil; its salts; its derivatives\" and the particulars relating to it the following item:\n\nNames Part I Part II Exempt\n\nGroup A Group B Group C Group D\n\n\"Mipomersen\n\nsodium\n\n- All preparations\";\n\n(vii) by inserting after the item \"Nystatin\" and the particulars relating to it the following item:\n\nNames Part I Part II Exempt\n\nGroup A Group B Group C Group D\n\n\"Ocriplasmin - All preparations\";\n\n(viii) by inserting after the item \"Octreotide; its salts\" and the particulars relating to it the following item:\n\nNames Part I Part II Exempt\n\nGroup A Group B Group C Group D\n\n\"Ofatumumab - All preparations\";\n\n(ix) by inserting after the item \"Pentoxifylline\" and the particulars relating to it the following item:\n\nNames Part I Part II Exempt\n\nGroup A Group B Group C Group D\n\n\"Perampanel - All preparations\";\n\n(x) in the item \"Racecadotril\", by substituting for \"Racecadotril\" and the particulars relating to it the following\n\nparticulars:\n\nNames Part I Part II Exempt\n\nGroup A Group B Group C GroupD\n\n\"Racecadotril - - All preparations\"; and\n\n(xi) by inserting after the item \"Vigabatrin\" and the particulars relating to it the following item:\n\nNames Part I Part II Exempt\n\n Group A Group B Group C Group D\n\n \"Vilanterol - All preparations\"; and\n\n(b) in the Appendix to the Poisons List—\n\n(i) in the list of \"Antineoplastic agents and Immunosuppressants:\", by inserting after the item \"Octreotide\" the\n\nitem \"Ofatumumab\";\n\n(ii) in the list of \"Anti-asthmatics:\", by inserting after the item \"Tulobuterol\" the item \"Vilanterol\";\n\n(iii) in the list of \"Anticonvulsants:\", by inserting after the item \"Paramethadione\" the item \"Perampanel\";\n\n(iv) in the list of \"Antidiabetics:\"—\n\n(A) by inserting after the item \"Chlorpropamide; its salts\" the item \"Dapagliflozin\"; and\n\n(B) by inserting after the item \"Liraglutide\" the item \"Lixisenatide\";\n\n(v) in the list of \"Antihistamines:\", by inserting after the item \"Bamipine\" the item \"Bilastine\";\n\n(vi) in the list of \"Antihypertensives:\", by inserting after the item \"Aliskiren\" the item \"Azilsartan\";\n\n(vii) in the list of \"Antiviral agents:\", by inserting after the item \"Didanosine\" the item \"Dolutegravir\"; and\n\n(viii) in the list \"Miscellaneous:\"—\n\n(A) by inserting after the item \"Metyrapone; its salts\" the item \"Mipomersen sodium\"; and\n\n(B) by inserting after the item \"Nux Vomica, alkaloids of\" the item \"Ocriplasmin\".\n\nMade 9 April 2014\n\n[KK(R)608(14); PN(PU2)172/XII]\n\nDATUK SERI DR. S. SUBRAMANIAM\n\n Minister of Health"
    },
    "noLabel": {
     "en": "Section 2"
    }
   }
  ]
 },
 "MY-H921": {
  "lawId": "MY-H921",
  "sourceLang": "ms",
  "targetLang": "en",
  "engine": "official-extract",
  "model": null,
  "promptVersion": null,
  "translatedAt": "2026-10-28",
  "reviewed": "official",
  "note": "公报原生英文版（与马来文版同一公报并置），逐字照录，非机译。",
  "articles": [
   {
    "no": 1,
    "text": {
     "en": "1. (1) This order may be cited as the Minimum Wages Order 2016.\n\n(2) This Order comes into operation on 1 July 2016.\n\nNon-application"
    },
    "noLabel": {
     "en": "Section 1"
    }
   },
   {
    "no": 2,
    "text": {
     "en": "2. This Order shall not apply to a domestic servant as defined under section 2 of the\n\nEmployment Act 1955 [Act 265], section 2 of the Sabah Labour Ordinance [Cap. 67] and\n\nsection 2 of the Sarawak Labour Ordinance [Cap. 76].\n\nMinimum wages rates"
    },
    "noLabel": {
     "en": "Section 2"
    }
   },
   {
    "no": 3,
    "text": {
     "en": "3. The minimum wages rates payable to an employee shall be as follows:\n\nRegional areas\n\nMinimum wages rates\n\nMonthly Daily Hourly\n\nPeninsular Malaysia RM1,000\n\nNumber of working days\n\nin a week\n\n6 RM38.46 RM4.81\n\n5 RM46.15\n\n4 RM57.69\n\nSabah, Sarawak and\n\nFederal Territory of\n\nLabuan\n\nRM920\n\n6 RM35.38\n\n5 RM42.46 RM4.42\n\n4 RM53.08\n\nRate of wages for employee paid based only on piece rate, tonnage, etc."
    },
    "noLabel": {
     "en": "Section 3"
    }
   },
   {
    "no": 4,
    "text": {
     "en": "4. In relation to an employee who is not paid basic wages but is paid wages based\n\nonly on piece rate, tonnage, task, trip or commission, the rate of monthly wages payable\n\nto the employee shall not be less than the following rate:\n\nRegional areas Rate of wages\n\n(Monthly)\n\nPeninsular Malaysia RM1,000\n\nSabah, Sarawak and Federal\n\nTerritory of Labuan RM920\n\nRevocation"
    },
    "noLabel": {
     "en": "Section 4"
    }
   },
   {
    "no": 5,
    "text": {
     "en": "5. The Minimum Wages Order 2012 [P.U. (A) 214/2012] is revoked.\n\nMade 27 April 2016\n\n[KSM/PUU(R) 600-1/2/17/1; PN(PU2)700/IV]\n\nDATO' SRI RICHARD RIOT ANAK JAEM\n\nMinister of Human Resources"
    },
    "noLabel": {
     "en": "Section 5"
    }
   }
  ]
 },
