  "articles": [
   {
    "no": 1,
    "text": {
     "en": "1. This order may be cited as the Registration of Pharmacists (Amendment\n\nof First Schedule) (No. 2) Order 2020.\n\nAmendment of First Schedule"
    },
    "noLabel": {
     "en": "Section 1"
    }
   },
   {
    "no": 2,
    "text": {
     "en": "2. The First Schedule to the Registration of Pharmacists Act 1951 is amended\n\nin relation to the country of \"Indonesia\", by inserting after the item \"University\n\nSumatera Utara\" and the particulars relating to it the following item and\n\nparticulars:\n\nName of Institution\n\ngranting qualification\n\nDescription of qualification\n\n\"Hasanuddin University (UNHAS) Sarjana Sains\n\n(Recognised on 8 November 2011)\".\n\nMade 7 April 2020\n\n[KKM.R.600-1/1/26 Jld.3(25); PN(PU2)200/IV]\n\nDato' Sri Dr. Adham bin Baba\n\nMinister of Health\n\nP.U. (A) 120.\n\nAKTA PENJARA 1995\n\nPeraturan-Peraturan Penjara 2000\n\nPEMBETULAN\n\nDalam P.U. (A) 325/2000 yang disiarkan pada 31 Ogos 2000 dalam teks\n\nbahasa Inggeris, dalam tajuk dan subperaturan 1(1), gantikan perkataan \"Prisons\"\n\ndengan perkataan \"Prison\".\n\n[KDN.S.171/926/1; PN(PU2)163/IV]"
    },
    "noLabel": {
     "en": "Section 2"
    }
   }
  ]
